 less than 1000g. Additionally, when you cast asell using this wand as your arcane focus, roll an ability check with yoursellcasting ability score. If you roll higher than 11 + thesell's level, you cast thesell without using asellslot. This fails if you have nosellslots remaining of thesell's level and therefore couldn't cast without succeeding.;White Onyx;49g 4s 2c;43g 6s;--;oil of bless weapon;102g 7s 3c;91g 5s 6c;This white draught smells like mint.
